{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"05719da6-e036-42c8-a446-7552860e2578":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":""}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_YQLC3N":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"d99a4356-ec44-4e94-b542-418d283b3bda":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_ctc4Yw":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Try other fruity flavours","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["peach","pomegranate"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"collapsible-row-2":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p><strong>Wild Berry<\/strong> is a sweet, <strong>fruity liqueur<\/strong> crafted from authentic high-proof moonshine spirit fused with essences of red berries (blackberry, raspberries & currants). A perfect mix of sweet, fresh and fruitiness. <\/p><p>Our <strong>berry liquor<\/strong> is great on the rocks or as part of a cocktail. Try our Wild Berry paired with lemonade and ice or topped with prosecco. You can find more Wild Berry recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktails page<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional <strong>Mason Jars<\/strong>, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs,<\/a> have a look at our entire product range and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><p>Curious? Simply order your berry liquor today online and we will ship the product anywhere in mainland UK within a few working days.<\/p>","page":""}},"548e0e9b-23a9-491d-ac35-0551d726f8ea":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-3":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<p><strong>Wild Berry Lemonade<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>50ml Wild Berry<\/li><li>Top with Lemonade<\/li><li>Fresh Lemon Slices<\/li><\/ul><p>Add Wild Berry to a tall glass with some ice. Top with lemonade and 2 slices of fresh lemon.<\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">here <\/a>to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"550a153b-10c2-4871-b2b5-59c77e8d3b4a":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless otherwise stated, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"collapsible-row-0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","05719da6-e036-42c8-a446-7552860e2578","price","description","variant_picker","da8ef1d6-d5ee-4fd6-a726-7c6359134946","quantity_selector","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_YQLC3N","d99a4356-ec44-4e94-b542-418d283b3bda","recommended_products_ctc4Yw","collapsible-row-2","548e0e9b-23a9-491d-ac35-0551d726f8ea","collapsible-row-3","collapsible-row-1","550a153b-10c2-4871-b2b5-59c77e8d3b4a","collapsible-row-0"],"settings":{"gift_card_receipient_enabled":false,"is_above_the_fold":true,"enable_sticky_info":true,"badges_enabled":false,"gallery_layout":"thumbnail","media_size":"small","mobile_thumbnails":"hide","hide_variants":true,"enable_video_looping":false,"padding_top":24,"padding_bottom":12}},"330b3aa8-0082-4129-a327-cd247d74741a":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16302858174595__330b3aa8-0082-4129-a327-cd247d74741a-1685023669da0b08ab-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Award-Winning Flavour","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16302858174595__330b3aa8-0082-4129-a327-cd247d74741a-1685023669da0b08ab-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>It's fresh fruit flavour and delicate balance of sharp and mellow notes has earned our Wild Berry Moonshine plenty of attention from the professional world. <\/p><p>This Moonshine was awarded the top accolade of Global Taste Master at the 2023 Spirits Business Awards, and came back to receive a further Gold Award in 2024!<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16302858174595__330b3aa8-0082-4129-a327-cd247d74741a-1685023669da0b08ab-0","template--16302858174595__330b3aa8-0082-4129-a327-cd247d74741a-1685023669da0b08ab-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Wild_Berry_1.jpg","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"ae899c57-d2a6-4a79-8b72-265cd500e3ef":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"template--16302858174595__ae899c57-d2a6-4a79-8b72-265cd500e3ef-1685023669da0b08ab-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Your Moonshine, Your Way","heading_size":"h2"}},"template--16302858174595__ae899c57-d2a6-4a79-8b72-265cd500e3ef-1685023669da0b08ab-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Whether you prefer your spirits neat over ice, mixed with soft drinks, or blended into intricate <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/wild-berry\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\/tagged\/wild-berry\">cocktails<\/a>, our Wild Berry is perfect for all occasions. <\/p><p><\/p><p>Check out our Perfect Serve section or <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktails<\/a> library for more inspiration. <\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["template--16302858174595__ae899c57-d2a6-4a79-8b72-265cd500e3ef-1685023669da0b08ab-0","template--16302858174595__ae899c57-d2a6-4a79-8b72-265cd500e3ef-1685023669da0b08ab-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_59.png","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"image_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left","content_layout":"overlap","color_scheme":"background-2","mobile_content_alignment":"left","padding_top":36,"padding_bottom":36}},"image-with-text":{"type":"image-with-text","blocks":{"image-with-text-0":{"type":"heading","settings":{"heading":"Fresh Berries & Summer Fruit","heading_size":"h2"}},"image-with-text-1":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>Wild Berry is a sweet & fruity liqueur, crafted using authentic high-proof Moonshine spirit which is then infused with the finest natural flavours of fresh berries and summer fruits.<\/p>","text_style":"body"}}},"block_order":["image-with-text-0","image-with-text-1"],"settings":{"is_above_the_fold":false,"background_color":"#ffffff","text_color":"#000000","image":"shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Untitled_design_58_96d93999-7cb4-413d-b03c-7c793caae416.png","image_caption":"","height":"adapt","desktop_image_width":"medium","layout":"text_first","desktop_content_position":"middle","desktop_content_alignment":"left"